<title>UK: London gold ends steady but quiet.</title>
<headline>London gold ends steady but quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Ends at $326.20/$326.70, near lower end of slow day's trading range.</p>
<p>SILVER - Drifts lower with gold and closes at 432/434 cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Remains steady at $425.00/$428.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ends steadier at $202.00/$205.00.</p>
